NOTE on the IAEA-CIELO Update to the U-233 JENDL-4.0 Evaluation   9222 1451
A. Trkov, R.Capote, IAEA, Dec.2016                                9222 1451
                                                                  9222 1451
The present file is not a genuine evaluation but merely a patch   9222 1451
correcting the thermal capture, fission and nu-bar to correspond  9222 1451
to the Standards_2006:                                            9222 1451
         Standards_2016   JENDL-4.0  IAEA-CIELO                   9222 1451
elastic [b]  12.2+/-0.7      12.177      12.178                   9222 1451
capture [b]  41.9+/-1.7      45.261      42.329                   9222 1451
fission [b] 534.5+/-2.4     531.355     534.072                   9222 1451
nu-bar_t   2.4853+/-0.0054    2.4845      2.48551                 9222 1451
                                                                  9222 1451
In addition, the nu-bar in the epithermal range below 200 keV     9222 1451
was increased by 0.8% to improve the performance in ICSBEP        9222 1451
fast benchmarks containing U-233.                                 9222 1451
                                                                  9222 1451
History                                                           9222 1451
06-07 Total and fission cross sections were modified.             9222 1451
06-10 Nu-p was modified.                                          9222 1451
07-06 Theoretical calculation was made with CCONE code.           9222 1451
07-08 Theoretical calculation was made with CCONE code.           9222 1451
07-11 Fission cross section was revised with simultaneous         9222 1451
      evaluation.                                                 9222 1451
07-12 Fission cross section was revised with new results of       9222 1451
      simultaneous evaluation.                                    9222 1451
08-01 Fission cross section was revised.                          9222 1451
08-02 Fission cross section and nu-p were revised.                9222 1451
      CCONE calculation was made with revised parameters.         9222 1451
08-03 Interpolation of (5,18) was changed.                        9222 1451
      Data were compiled as JENDL/AC-2008/1/.                     9222 1451
09-04 MF01 was revised.                                           9222 1451
09-08 (MF1,MT458) was evaluated.                                  9222 1451
09-10 fission cross section was revised.                          9222 1451
10-01 Data of prompt gamma rays due to fission were given.        9222 1451
10-03 Covariance data were given.                                 9222 1451
